Error [jet.ReturnTypeMismatch]: This value is Int (a whole number), but `low_byte` returns U8
  --> Tests/UI/E0113_int_narrowing_result.jet:1:30
    |
  1 | low_byte: fn(n: Int) -> U8 { n }
    |                              ^
 Why: `low_byte` declares U8 as its result, so the value it hands back must be U8
 Fix: Convert it with `checked(U8{value}) ?? fallback`; the conversion is `None` when the value doesn't fit in U8
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
